              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zonke izitsha zokuphuza zenkosi uSolomoni zazingezegolide, nazo zonke izitsha zendlu yehlathi laseLebanoni zazingezegolide elicwengekileyo; kwakungekho okwesiliva; kakubalelwa lutho ngakho ezinsukwini zikaSolomoni.",
          "type": "text",
