              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba inkosi yayinemikhumbi yaseTharishishi olwandle kanye nemikhumbi kaHiramu; kanye ngeminyaka emithathu imikhumbi yaseTharishishi yafika iletha igolide, nesiliva, nezimpondo zendlovu, nezinkawu, namapigogo.",
          "type": "text",
