              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wabutha izinqola nabamahhashi, waba nezinqola eziyinkulungwane namakhulu amane nabamahhashi abayizinkulungwane eziyishumi nambili, wakunika imizi yezinqola nenkosi yaseJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
