              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inqola yakhuphuka yaphuma eGibithe ngamashekeli angamakhulu ayisithupha esiliva nehhashi ngekhulu namashumi ayisihlanu; bawakhiphela kuwo onke amakhosi amaHeti nasemakhosini ase-Aramu ngesandla sabo.",
          "type": "text",
